    "text": "oregonbusiness.com\nwebsite\nOregon\nElmer’s Will Take Over Four Shari’s Locations\nBy Garrett Andrews,\n10 hours agoOne Pacific Northwest diner will take over for another at four locations around Oregon. A handful of now-defunct Shari’s Cafe & Pies locations will live again — in the form of an apparently more resilient Pacific Northwest diner chain. Elmer’s Restaurant will take over four former Shari’s diners...\n44",
